@startuml
' Yang Shuo with OpenAI Codex assistance. #641; Benjamin's search/retrieval work retained.
' Trace: CanonicalPeopleSession SEARCH; LessonRetrieval.search; LessonQueries.searchLessons.
!include feature-sequence-style.iuml
participant "session :\nCanonicalPeopleSession" as S
participant "retrieval :\nLessonRetrieval" as R
participant "queries :\nLessonQueries" as Q

S -> S : SearchCriteriaParser parses\nc/lesson and valid filters
S -> R : search(criteria)
R -> Q : setLessonFilter(criteria)
Q -> Q : Start with smallest exact\nweekday/time bucket
loop each candidate Lesson
  Q -> Q : Match all Lesson criteria\nand its current roster
end
Q -> Q : Apply creation or schedule order;\nreplace filtered result list
Q --> R : query source updated
R -> R : Set heading and select\nfiltered source
ref over R : Source binding and refresh — 5.6
R --> S : displayed results
S -> S : Hide history panel
note over S, Q
  Worked example: [L1,L2] -> [L1].
  Duplicate roster matches emit one Lesson.
  Invalid criteria leave prior results unchanged.
  No operational save; people filter is unchanged.
end note
@enduml
